diffusers
    https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers
    Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) HuggingFace Inc.

    Used as the numerical reference implementation for the golden-tensor test
    harness (see xtask/golden/). Module layouts and parameter naming follow
    diffusers conventions so that pretrained weights load unmodified.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
transformers
    https://github.com/huggingface/transformers
    Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) HuggingFace Inc.

    Used as the numerical reference for the CLIP text and vision towers, the
    T5 encoder, and the tokenizers. Parameter naming in `sd-models/clip` and
    `sd-models/t5` follows transformers conventions (`q_proj`, `layer_norm1`)
    rather than diffusers', because that is the layout those checkpoints ship
    in.

